.DS_Store

# data/*.csv, data/*.json, and charts/*.png were previously gitignored as
# disposable local cache. They're now tracked on purpose: the cloud daily/
# weekly routine runs in a network-sandboxed environment that can't reach
# bitstamp.net, so a separate GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/
# fetch-btc.yml) fetches and commits this data on a schedule instead, and
# the cloud routine reads it from the git checkout rather than fetching it
# itself. See that workflow's comments for the full picture.
